🎯 Master Cheat Sheet
Principle	One-Line Rule	Fintech Example	Mental Test
SRP	One class, one job	PaymentProcessor only processes, never sends SMS	"How many reasons can this class change?"
OCP	Add don't modify	New payment = new class, not if-else in processor	"Did I touch existing code to add this?"
LSP	Child keeps parent's promise	FDAccount doesn't fake withdraw()	"Can child replace parent without surprises?"
ISP	No fat interfaces	PrepaidCard only implements Payable, not EMICapable	"Is any method throwing empty exception?"
DIP	Depend on interface, not class	PaymentService uses PaymentGateway, not RazorpayGateway	"Can I swap the dependency without touching this class?"
