Class	Has Class-Level User State?	Scope	Reason
PaymentService	❌ No	Singleton	Just calls repos, no user data stored
FraudDetectionService	❌ No	Singleton	Just checks rules, no user data
SpinTheWheelService	❌ No	Singleton	All data in local variables
NotificationService	❌ No	Singleton	Just sends messages, no state
GameEligibilityRepository	❌ No	Singleton	Just DB calls, no state
PaymentReceiptGenerator	✅ Yes	Prototype	Stores userId, amount, txnId in fields
