Structural Pattern Differences (Most Asked!)
PROXY     → Same interface, CONTROLS ACCESS
            Use: Logging, Security, Caching, Transactions
            Spring: @Transactional, @Cacheable

ADAPTER   → Different interfaces, TRANSLATES
            Use: Legacy system integration, Third-party APIs
            Spring: Wrapping old bank APIs

DECORATOR → Same interface, ADDS FEATURES
            Use: Stacking behaviours dynamically
            Spring: Notification channels (SMS + Email + WhatsApp)

